    "detailed_description": "In this <strong>pixel art precision platformer</strong> you play as Eva, <strong>the last fox</strong>. Follow her on a quest to uncover the truth of what came to be of the rest of her kind.  Explore the wonders and horrors of this <strong>hand crafted pixel art world</strong>, as you pass through your ever changing surroundings. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1371570/extras/88186af76478b2352ab190b6998d4ef3.poster.avif?t=1754514147\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1371570/extras/88186af76478b2352ab190b6998d4ef3.webm?t=1754514147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1371570/extras/88186af76478b2352ab190b6998d4ef3.mp4?t=1754514147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><u>Features</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast Paced <strong>Precision Platforming</strong><br></li><li> Hundreds of <strong>Handcrafted </strong>Sections<br></li><li> Detailed and <strong>Expansive Narrative</strong> <br></li><li> Tougher Optional <strong>Challenges and Collectables</strong></li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1371570/extras/72b34f7458cd23109b51ccaf9fba1885.poster.avif?t=1754514147\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1371570/extras/72b34f7458cd23109b51ccaf9fba1885.webm?t=1754514147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1371570/extras/72b34f7458cd23109b51ccaf9fba1885.mp4?t=1754514147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
